  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**A binding is inert only while its subject cannot exist.** Recreate the namespace with the same account name and the grant is live again, silently — which is how two `cluster-admin` bindings to a decommissioned Portainer survived until 2026-09-22, one of them since 2024. They were found by hand; nothing measured them.\n\nRead **left to right**: *privileged orphans* is the only number that justifies interrupting someone. *cluster-admin bindings* is a **drift** gauge — the level is inherited from Helm, Harvester and Rancher, the growth is the finding. Built-in Kubernetes RBAC (`kubernetes.io/bootstrapping`) is excluded: without that filter 10 of every 12 findings are noise. Source: `f/probe/rbac_hygiene`, daily 05:17, read-only."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Privileged orphans",
      "description": "Bindings to cluster-admin, or to a role granting *:*, whose ServiceAccount subject cannot exist. Baseline 0 since the 2026-09-22 sweep. Anything above 0 is the exact class that caused this probe to be written.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rbac_orphaned_bindings_privileged",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "privileged",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Orphans — namespace gone",
      "description": "The subject's whole namespace no longer exists. Strong signal: nothing recreates that identity by accident. Baseline 0.",
