    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uncollectable owner references",
      "description": "Cluster-scoped RBAC objects naming a NAMESPACED owner. Kubernetes refuses that ownership, so garbage collection can never fire and the cascade only looks wired — sandbox-sandbox survived two years that way. Baseline 1 (cattle-cleanup).",
