    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Orphaned bindings — the two classes are not equally damning",
      "description": "Namespace gone is strong evidence of a leftover. ServiceAccount missing is weak: upstream charts name accounts they never create, which is why its baseline is 2 rather than 0.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 9
